stimulus_preparation/external_corpora/nowac-1.1.lemma.frek.sort_alf_frek.txt
data/final data/merged_data.csv
*.mp4
*.eeg
*.wksp2
*.Rdata
*.Rhistory
.Rproj.user
.Rproj.user/*
desktop.ini
# Python bytecode from the EEG reconstruction and audit scripts, and the default plot file an
# R session writes when a plotting call has no device open.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
Rplots.pdf
# Credential-bearing R startup files. SCOPUS_API_KEY is read from ~/.Renviron, and a
# project-local copy would otherwise be committed.
.Renviron
.Rprofile.local

# --- Two-paper Bayesian workspace (paper_1_transfer / paper_2_plasticity) -----
# The resting-state recordings are not a separate tree: they sit in the task-EEG tree
# as "data/raw data/EEG/Session 2/Export/<ppt>_RS_eyes_{closed,open}.{txt,vhdr}", which
# Paper 2's script 03 reads locally and which are small enough to keep. Their raw
# BrainVision counterparts are excluded above by the blanket *.eeg rule, and are
# available at https://osf.io/tq7vy.
# Heavy derived datasets reproducible from scripts (single-trial RDS, PSD tables).
paper_1_transfer/data_derived/
paper_2_plasticity/data_derived/
# Fitted brms/Stan objects are large; regenerated by the model scripts.
paper_1_transfer/results/*.rds
paper_2_plasticity/results/*.rds
# Stan/cmdstanr scratch and compiled model artefacts.
*.stan
!**/stan/*.stan
*_cmdstan_*
# Quarto render artefacts.
/paper_1_transfer/*_files/
/paper_2_plasticity/*_files/
/paper_1_transfer/*.tex
/paper_2_plasticity/*.tex
.quarto/

# Legacy container images, rendered HTML and HPC job logs
*.sif
/paper_1_transfer/*.html
/paper_2_plasticity/*.html
/paper_1_transfer/hpc/logs/
/paper_2_plasticity/hpc/logs/

# Rendered PDFs under a paper's root are build artefacts and stay out of the repository,
# with one exception each: the three rendered manuscripts are deliverables, not artefacts.
# They are what the co-authors and the journals receive, so they are tracked in place and
# negated here. The two .docx outputs are tracked for the same reason and are not matched
# by these patterns. The *_review_draft.* files at the repository root are frozen copies of
# what was sent to the co-authors on a given date, tracked as a record.
/paper_1_transfer/*.pdf
/paper_2_plasticity/*.pdf
!/paper_1_transfer/paper_1_morphosyntax.pdf
!/paper_2_plasticity/paper_2_neuroplasticity.pdf
!/paper_2_plasticity/supplement.pdf

# Correspondence drafts stay out of the compendium (ISSUES.md X4-14).
PI_*.md

# The owner files Word and Excel write beside a document while it is open.
~$*
